# Files Docker never sends to the build. The Dockerfile only copies what it needs anyway;
# this keeps the build fast and makes sure secrets can't end up in an image by accident.
.git
**/node_modules
.env
.env.*
logs
**/*.log
**/*.test.ts
docs
.claude
CLAUDE.md
.vscode
# Built or generated locally: the image builds its own dashboard.
**/dist
coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
evals/reports
spike
